       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.       TINVRNG.
       AUTHOR.           DALE HOERLE.
      *INSTALLATION.     GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
      *DATE-WRITTEN.     JULY 1985.
       DATE-COMPILED.    CURRENT-DATE.
      *REMARKS.
      *    STOREROOM INVENTORY WORKSHEET CREATE BATCH JOB.
      *  THIS JOB IS STREAMED OUT OF 'TINVWS' THE CREATE INVENTORY
      *  WORKSHEET SCREEN PROGRAM.

      *C  07/24/1992        DAVE PLUM       REQUEST #6250
      *C  CHANGED THE BIN LOCATION VALUE WHICH IS MOVED TO SORT-BIN
      *C  WHEN CODES ARE BEING SELECTED BY BIN LOCATION.  PRIOR TO
      *C  THIS CHANGE THE PRIMARY BIN LOCATION (1) WAS ALWAYS BEING
      *C  USED.  WITH THIS CHANGE, THE BIN LOCATION WHICH QUALIFIED THE
      *C  CODE FOR THE WORKSHEET WITH BE USED AS THE SORT-BIN.
      *C  ---COMPLETED THIS CHANGE 13AUG1992
      *C
      *C  11/30/92       BK DISMUKES    REQUEST #6315
      *C     CHANGED PRINT OUT TO INCLUDE 2 MORE LINES OF DESCRIPTION.
      *C     MADE LOGICAL CHANGES IN 7010-RETURN-LOOP,
      *C     8060-PRINT-DESCRIPTION AND 8070-MOVE-BIN.  ALSO CHANGED
      *C     HEADER-2 IN THE PRINT AREA OF WORKING STORAGE TO REPLACE
      *C     "<DESCRIPTION>" WITH KEYWORD/MODIFIER.
      *C
      *C  01/31/94       JS BUNGO
      *C     ADDED CALL TO ESTABLISH THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER FOR
      *C     THIS BATCH PROGRAM.
      *C  11/02/94       JS BUNGO
      *C     ADDED CHECK TO SEE IF ANY CODES WERE FROZEN FOR THIS
      *C     WORKSHEET.  IF NO CODES WERE FROZEN, THEN THE WORKSHEET
      *C     IS DELETED AND A MESSAGE IS PRINTED ON THE LAST PAGE
      *C     OF THE PRINTED WORKSHEET REPORT.
      *C
      *C 06/12/96       JEFF BUNGO
      *C     EXPANDED DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C     INCLUDE CENTURY FOR LAST ACTIVITY AND INVENTORY DATES.
      *C     ALSO INCLUDE CENTURY IN CALCULATION OF OVERDUE INVENTORY.
      *C
      *C  06/20/2002    CA YODER    LAWTON REQUEST
      *C  ADDED LOGIC TO PROCESS NEW OPTION IN TINVWS PROGRAM.  FOR
      *C  "FREEZE ALL CODES DUE TO BE INVENTORIED," ADDED OPTION TO
      *C  SPECIFY MAXIMUM NUMBER OF CODES TO FREEZE AT ONE TIME.
      *C
      *C  12/03/2002    CA YODER    UNION CITY REQUEST
      *C  ADDED LOGIC TO PROCESS NEW OPTION IN TINVWS PROGRAM.  FOR
      *C  FREEZING A RANGE OF CODES, ADDED THE ABILITY TO SELECT CODES
      *C  WITH NO ACTIVITY FOR A CERTAIN NUMBER OF MONTHS.
      *C
      *C  05/25/2004    CA YODER
      *C  FIXED DISPLAY OF BLOWUP MESSAGES TO PROVIDE MORE INFORMATION.
      *C
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.   HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.   HP-3000.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-PK-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MSTORERM-CD-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT INVFILE ASSIGN TO DATABASE-INVFILE.
           SELECT PRINTFILE ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
           SELECT SORT-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD INVFILE
           RECORD CONTAINS 7 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS INV-RECORD.
       01  INV-RECORD.
           05  INV-CODE                  PIC X(7).

       FD PRINTFILE
           RECORD CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS PRINT-RECORD.
       01 PRINT-RECORD.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(132).

       SD  SORT-FILE
           RECORD CONTAINS 86 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS SORT-REC.
       01  SORT-REC.
           05  SORT-NOTHING              PIC X(1).
           05  SORT-CODE                 PIC X(8).
           05  SORT-BIN                  PIC X(12).
           05  SORT-CLASS                PIC X(4).
           05  SORT-DATE                 PIC X(8).
           05  SORT-PRINT-STATUS         PIC X.
           05  SORT-HU                   PIC X(2).
           05  SORT-KEYWORD-ADJ          PIC X(50).

      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
       FD  MPLTINFO-PK-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-PK-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  MSTORERM-CD-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-CD-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0200  OF MCFLCS0201.
      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  DUIN-FLAG                     PIC X(1).
       01  HIGH-USE-FLAG                 PIC X(1).
       01  BIN-FLAG                      PIC X(1).
       01  HOLD-INV-DATE                 PIC X(8).
       01  SAVE-PRT-INV-FLAG             PIC X(1).
       01  SUB                           PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
       01  HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG            PIC X(1)  VALUE "Y".
       01  PRT-LINE-CTR                  PIC S9(2)   VALUE 0.
       01  ALL-ITEMS                     PIC XX    VALUE "@;".
       01  CODE-ON-WORKSHEET             PIC X     VALUE "N".
       01  SAVE-NUM-CODES                PIC 9(4)  VALUE 0.

       01  MCXCBLERR-SCOPE               PIC X     VALUE "C".

      *----------  USED TO ADD DESCRIPTION LINES TO PRT-LINE-CTR
      *            TO SEE IF ITEM WOULD CONTINUE ON TO NEXT PAGE.
       01  PAGE-BREAK-LINE               PIC S9(4)   VALUE 0.

       01  HD-RET-CODE                   PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
       01  HD-FILE-NAME                  PIC X(17) VALUE "DHDR26.PUB" .
       01  FNUM                          PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.

       COPY ESCNAM2   IN COPYLIB.
      * ***************************************************************
      * *                  SUBSCRIPTS AND COUNTERS                    *
      * ***************************************************************

       01  STR-INDEX                     PIC 99.
       01  DESC-INDEX                    PIC 99.

       01  COUNTERS.
           05  PAGE-K                    PIC 99         VALUE 0.
           05  LINE-K                    PIC 99         VALUE 99.
           05  CODES-ON-PAGE-COUNT       PIC 9          VALUE 5.

      *****************************************************************
      **                                                             **
      **        S U B P R O G R A M   A R E A S                      **
      **                                                             **
      *****************************************************************
       COPY CDESC      IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CCRTFILE   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY OVRPFDAT   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CCHKOBJ    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY COMMAND    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TDATECHK   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY VCOMLINK   IN COPYLIB.

       01  OVR-FROMFILE                  PIC X(26) VALUE "INVFILE".
       01  OVR-TOFILE.
           05  OVR-TOFILE-PREFIX         PIC X(4)  VALUE "DINV".
           05  OVR-TOFILE-NUMBER         PIC 9(4).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(18)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  DLTF-FILENAME                 PIC X(26).

       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-TEXT.
               10  MESSAGE-BUFFER-1        PIC X(1).
               10  FILLER                  PIC X(63).
           05  MSG-FLD                     PIC X(14).
           05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD PIC Z(13)9.

      *****************************************************************
      **                                                             **
      **      D A T A B A S E   W O R K                              **
      **                                                             **
      *****************************************************************
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X  VALUE "0".

      *******************************************************
      **  BASE AND DBSTAT IS IN LINKAGE SECTION ON THE HP  **
      *******************************************************
       01  BASE                          PIC X(10).
       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DBMODES IN COPYLIB.
       01  PLT-ARG                       PIC X(4) VALUE "PIPT".
       01  CODE-ARG                      PIC X(8).
       01  DSET-NAME                     PIC X(16).
       01  DSET-MPLTINFO                 PIC X(16)  VALUE "MPLTINFO;".
       01  DSET-MSTORERM                 PIC X(16)  VALUE "MSTORERM;".

      *****************************************************************
      **                                                             **
      **       D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S                       **
      **                                                             **
      *****************************************************************
       COPY MSTORERM   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DPOITEM    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DRCVITEM   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DWLITEM    IN COPYLIB.

       01  BUF-MWRKLIST.
           05  MWL-KEY                   PIC X(6).
           05  WL-DATE                   PIC 9(4).
           05  FILLER                    PIC XX.

       01  BUF-MPLTINFO.
           05  MPLTINFO-KEY              PIC X(4).
           05  MPLTINFO-DATA             PIC X(60).
           05  MPLTINFO-PRINTER REDEFINES MPLTINFO-DATA.
               10  MPLTINFO-JSPOOLER     PIC X(2).
               10  MPLTINFO-JSPOOL-TYPE  PIC X(2).
               10  FILLER                PIC X(56).

       COPY MPLTPIPT   IN COPYLIB.

      *********************
      *                   *
      *    DATES          *
      *                   *
      *********************

       01  JULIANS.
           05  TODAYS-JULIAN             PIC S9(4)  COMP.
           05  LAST-INVS-JULIAN          PIC S9(4)  COMP.
           05  DIFF                      PIC S9(5).
           05  YEAR-DIFF                 PIC S9(2).
           05  YEAR-DAYS                 PIC S9(5).
           05  LAST-YEAR                 PIC 9999.
           05  TODAYS-YEAR               PIC 9999.

       01  CENTURY-YEAR.
           05  CENTURY                   PIC 99 VALUE 19.
           05  YEAR                      PIC 99.

       01  GREGORIAN-DATE.
           05  GREGORIAN-YEAR            PIC X(2).
           05  GREGORIAN-MONTH           PIC X(2).
           05  GREGORIAN-DAY             PIC X(2).

      *01  JULIAN-DATE.
      *    05  FILLER                    PIC X(2).
      *    05  JULIAN-DATE-NUM           PIC X(3).

       01  JULIAN-DATE.
           05  JD-YY        PIC 99   VALUE ZEROES.
           05  JD-DDD       PIC 999  VALUE ZEROES.
           05  JULIAN-DATE-NUM REDEFINES JD-DDD
                            PIC X(3).

       01  DAYS-AGO-60      PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
       01  DAYS-AGO-RED REDEFINES DAYS-AGO-60.
           05  DAR-CC         PIC 99.
           05  DAYS-AGO-YMD.
               10  DAR-YY     PIC 99.
               10  DAR-MM     PIC 99.
               10  DAR-DD     PIC 99.

       01  TODAYS-DATE-CYMD.
           05  TODAYS-DATE-CC   PIC 99.
           05  TODAYS-DATE-YMD.
               10  TODAYS-DATE-YY   PIC 99.
               10  TODAYS-DATE-MM   PIC 99.
               10  TODAYS-DATE-DD   PIC 99.

       01  CHECK-DATE-CYMD.
           05  CHECK-DATE-CCYY      PIC 9(4).
           05  CHECK-DATE-MM        PIC 9(2).
           05  CHECK-DATE-DD        PIC 9(2).


      ***********************************************************
      *                PRINT AREA                               *
      ***********************************************************

       01  PRINT-LINES.
           03  HEADER-0.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(21)
                    VALUE " ********************".
           03  HEADER-1.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(5)    VALUE SPACES.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(5) VALUE "PAGE ".
               05  PAGE-NO               PIC ZZ9.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(17)   VALUE SPACES.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(26)
                   VALUE "CODES FROZEN FOR INVENTORY".
               05  FILLER                PIC X(5)   VALUE SPACES.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(12)
                     VALUE "WORK SHEET #".
               05  P-WS-NUM              PIC 9(4).
           03  HEADER-1A.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(6)  VALUE "SORT: ".
               05  PRT-SORT-KEY          PIC X(18) VALUE SPACES.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(8)  VALUE "SELECT: ".
               05  PRT-SELECT-KEY        PIC X(18) VALUE SPACES.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
               05  PRT-LOW-VALUE         PIC X(12) VALUE SPACES.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(3)  VALUE " - ".
               05  PRT-HIGH-VALUE        PIC X(12) VALUE SPACES.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
               05  PRT-OTHER-LIT         PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.
               05  PRT-OTHER-NUM         PIC ZZZ9.
           03  PRINT-LINE1.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(1)   VALUE SPACES.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(7)   VALUE "CODE - ".
               05  P-CODE                PIC X(8)   VALUE SPACES.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(9)   VALUE "    UM - ".
               05  P-UM                  PIC XX     VALUE SPACES.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(12)  VALUE
                   "    CLASS - ".
               05  P-CLASS               PIC X(4)   VALUE SPACES.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(5)   VALUE SPACES.
               05  P-MESG                PIC X(32)  VALUE SPACES.
           03  LOCAL-CODE-MSG.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(13)  VALUE
                   "LOCAL CODE - ".
               05  P-LC                  PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(7)   VALUE SPACES.
           03  P-LINE-2.
               05  P-DESC                PIC X(80)  VALUE SPACES.
           03  PRINT-LINE2 REDEFINES P-LINE-2.
               05  P-DESC-2              PIC X(40).
               05  P-DESC-3              PIC X(40).
           03  HEADER-2.
               05  P-DESC-HEAD           PIC X(51) VALUE SPACES.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(29)
      *             VALUE "¦ <BIN LOCATIONS>".
                    VALUE "* <BIN LOCATIONS>".
           03  PRINT-LINE3.
               05  P-BIN-LOC             PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
               05  P-UNDERLINE           PIC X(4)   VALUE "____".
           03  PRINT-LINE4.
               05  P-DESC-4              PIC X(51) VALUE SPACES.
               05  FILLER                PIC X(2)  VALUE "* ".
      *        05  FILLER                PIC X(2)  VALUE "¦ ".
               05  P-BIN                 PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.
               05  P-BIN-ONHAND          PIC Z(8).
           03  NO-CODES-PRINT-LINES.
               05  P-NO-CODE-BANNER.
                   10 FILLER             PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.
                   10 FILLER             PIC X(40) VALUE ALL "*".
               05  P-NO-CODE-SKIP.
                   10 FILLER             PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.
                   10  FILLER            PIC X(2)  VALUE "**".
                   10  FILLER            PIC X(36) VALUE SPACES.
                   10  FILLER            PIC X(2)  VALUE "**".
               05  P-NO-CODE-LINE1.
                   10 FILLER             PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.
                   10 FILLER             PIC X(40) VALUE
                   "**  THIS WORKSHEET WAS NOT CREATED    **".
               05  P-NO-CODE-LINE2.
                   10 FILLER             PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.
                   10 FILLER             PIC X(40) VALUE
                   "**  BECAUSE NO CODES COULD BE FROZEN. **".
               05  P-NO-CODE-LINE3.
                   10  FILLER            PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.
                   10  FILLER            PIC X(40) VALUE
                   "**  SEE ERROR MESSAGE FOR EACH CODE.  **".

       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *******************************************************************
      *  LANGSUB AND VCOMLINK ARE IN LINKAGE SECTION OF THE HP, BUT NOT *
      *    ON THE IBM.                                                  *
      *******************************************************************
       COPY THDPRTB IN COPYLIB.
       01  OPTION-REC.
           05  SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE        PIC X.
           05  SF-FREEZE-TYPE            PIC X.
               88  SINGLE-CODES             VALUE "1".
               88  RANGE-OF-CODES           VALUE "2".
               88  RANGE-OF-BIN             VALUE "3".
               88  RANGE-OF-CLASS           VALUE "4".
               88  ALL-CODES                VALUE "5".
               88  ALL-CODES-DUIN           VALUE "6".
               88  RANGE-HIGHUSE            VALUE "7".
               88  WIPE-OUT-WORKSHEET       VALUE "D".
           05  SF-SORT-OPTION            PIC X.
           05  SF-LOW-VALUE              PIC X(12).
           05  SF-HIGH-VALUE             PIC X(12).
           05  SF-SPOOL-PRT              PIC 9(2).
           05  SF-NUM                    PIC 9(4).
           05  SF-CLASS-SELECT           PIC X(4).
           05  SF-MAX-CODES              PIC 9(4).
           05  SF-NUM-MONTHS             PIC 9(2).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(37).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(81).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING HD-ROUTE-DATA, OPTION-REC.
       MAIN SECTION.
       1000-HOUSEKEEPING.
           MOVE "C" TO MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.
           CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.
           PERFORM 9999-OPEN-STUFF.

      **********************************************
      * GET THE DATE 60 DAYS AGO.  THIS IS FOR THE *
      * DUIN SELECTION MODE (TYPE 6).  ITEMS WITH  *
      * ZERO ONHAND WILL ONLY BE FROZEN IF THEY    *
      * HAVEN'T BEEN INVENTORIED IN OVER 60 DAYS   *
      * OR THEY'VE PASSED THEIR INVENTORY CYCLE.   *
      **********************************************
           ACCEPT JULIAN-DATE FROM DAY.
           IF JD-DDD > 60
             SUBTRACT 60 FROM JD-DDD
           ELSE
             ADD 305 TO JD-DDD
             IF JD-YY > 0
                 SUBTRACT 1 FROM JD-YY
             ELSE
                 MOVE 99 TO JD-YY.
           MOVE JD-YY TO YEAR.
           IF YEAR > 70
              MOVE 19 TO CENTURY
           ELSE
              MOVE 20 TO CENTURY.
           MOVE "00000000"   TO DAYS-AGO-60.
           CALL "CJULIAN" USING CENTURY-YEAR, DAR-MM, DAR-DD,
                                              JD-DDD.
           MOVE JD-YY   TO DAR-YY.
           IF DAR-YY > 70
               MOVE 19 TO DAR-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE 20 TO DAR-CC.

      *------- GET DATE TO CHECK FOR NO ACTIVITY IN THE LAST XX MONTHS.
           IF SF-NUM-MONTHS > 0
               MOVE 1                 TO  DATE-MODE
               CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA
               MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT      TO  TODAYS-DATE-YMD
               MOVE "20"              TO  TODAYS-DATE-CC
               MOVE TODAYS-DATE-CYMD  TO  CHECK-DATE-CYMD
               PERFORM UNTIL CHECK-DATE-MM > SF-NUM-MONTHS
                   SUBTRACT 1 FROM CHECK-DATE-CCYY
                   ADD 12 TO CHECK-DATE-MM
               END-PERFORM
               SUBTRACT SF-NUM-MONTHS FROM CHECK-DATE-MM.

           CALL "TESCSEQ" USING ESC-NAME.
           MOVE "PIPT"                   TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE "N" TO HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG.
           PERFORM 9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I.
           MOVE "Y" TO HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG.
           IF NO-ENTRY
               MOVE "N"                  TO  SAVE-PRT-INV-FLAG
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-PHYS-INV-SW TO  SAVE-PRT-INV-FLAG.
           MOVE "N" TO CODE-ON-WORKSHEET.

      *------ OVERRIDE THE INVENTORY WORKSHEET FILE TO BE OUTPUT
      *------ TO THE CORRECT FILE NAME.  FOR EXAMPLE, WORKSHEET #245
      *------ GOES IN FILE DINV0245.  'TINVWS' ALWAYS DOES THE
      *------ CREATE OF THE WORKSHEET FILE.  A WORKSHEET FILE IS
      *------ CREATED ONLY IF WE ARE FREEZING CODES, OR IF WE ARE
      *------ UNFREEZING SINGLE CODES.  ALSO, OPTION 'D' IS PASSED FROM
      *------ THE INVENTORY UPDATE PROGRAM 'TINVUP' TO UNFREEZE
      *------ ANY REMAINING CODES ON THE WORKSHEET.
           IF SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "A" OR SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "D"
           OR SINGLE-CODES
               MOVE SF-NUM               TO  OVR-TOFILE-NUMBER
               PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE.

      *------ IF SINGLE CODES, THE CODE FILE WAS FILLED UP IN 'TINVWS'.
      *------ IF FROM 'TINVUP', THE CODE FILE IS ALREADY THERE.  IF
      *------ FREEZING, WE FILL UP THE CODE FILE IN THIS PROGRAM.
      *------ IF UNFREEZING A RANGE, NO CODE FILE IS NEEDED.
           IF SINGLE-CODES OR SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "D"
               OPEN INPUT INVFILE
           ELSE
           IF SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "A"
               OPEN OUTPUT INVFILE.

           IF SF-SORT-OPTION = "0"
               SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-NOTHING
                 INPUT PROCEDURE IS 6000-INPUT-CODES THRU 6990-IC-X
                 OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 7000-OUTPUT-CODES THRU 7990-OC-X
           ELSE
           IF SF-SORT-OPTION = "1"
               SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-CODE
                 INPUT PROCEDURE IS 6000-INPUT-CODES THRU 6990-IC-X
                 OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 7000-OUTPUT-CODES THRU 7990-OC-X
           ELSE
           IF SF-SORT-OPTION = "2"
               SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-BIN, SORT-CODE
                 INPUT PROCEDURE IS 6000-INPUT-CODES THRU 6990-IC-X
                 OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 7000-OUTPUT-CODES THRU 7990-OC-X
           ELSE
           IF SF-SORT-OPTION = "3"
               SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-CLASS, SORT-CODE
                 INPUT PROCEDURE IS 6000-INPUT-CODES THRU 6990-IC-X
                 OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 7000-OUTPUT-CODES THRU 7990-OC-X
           ELSE
           IF SF-SORT-OPTION = "4"
               SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-DATE, SORT-CODE
                 INPUT PROCEDURE IS 6000-INPUT-CODES THRU 6990-IC-X
                 OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 7000-OUTPUT-CODES THRU 7990-OC-X
           ELSE
           IF SF-SORT-OPTION = "5"
               SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-HU, SORT-CODE
                 INPUT PROCEDURE IS 6000-INPUT-CODES THRU 6990-IC-X
                 OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 7000-OUTPUT-CODES THRU 7990-OC-X
           ELSE
           IF SF-SORT-OPTION = "6"
               SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-KEYWORD-ADJ,
                                               SORT-CODE
                 INPUT PROCEDURE IS 6000-INPUT-CODES THRU 6990-IC-X
                 OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 7000-OUTPUT-CODES THRU 7990-OC-X
           ELSE
               SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-CODE
                 INPUT PROCEDURE IS 6000-INPUT-CODES THRU 6990-IC-X
                 OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 7000-OUTPUT-CODES THRU 7990-OC-X.

           IF SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "A" OR SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "D"
           OR SINGLE-CODES
               CLOSE INVFILE.
           PERFORM 9999-CLOSE-STUFF.

      *------ IF CALLED FROM 'TINVUP', WE DELETE THE CODE FILE.
      *------ OR IF CALLED FROM 'TINVWS' AND WE ARE UNFREEZING SINGLE
      *------ CODES.
      *------   OR IF CALLED FROM TINVWS AND WE FIND NO CODES TO FREEZE.
           IF SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "D"
           OR (SINGLE-CODES AND SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "B")
           OR (SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "A" AND CODE-ON-WORKSHEET = "N")
               MOVE OVR-TOFILE             TO  DLTF-FILENAME
               CALL "CDLTF" USING DLTF-FILENAME.

           GOBACK.

       2100-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "TINVRNG"                TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE BU-PGM-NAME STATUS-AREA
             VIEW-COMAREA FILE-STATUS BU-DISPLAY-MSG
             BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

       6000-INPUT-CODES.
           MOVE SPACES               TO  CODE-ARG.

           IF SINGLE-CODES OR SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "D"
             NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
             PERFORM 9999-BEGFIL-MSTORERM-CD-O.

       6100-INPUT-CODE-LOOP.
           IF SINGLE-CODES OR SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "D"
             READ INVFILE
               AT END PERFORM 9999-RESET-MSTORERM-CD-O
                      GO TO 6990-IC-X
             END-READ
             MOVE INV-CODE             TO  CODE-ARG
             PERFORM 9999-GETKEY-MSTORERM-CD-O
           ELSE
             PERFORM 9999-GETSER-MSTORERM-CD-O
             IF END-OF-FILE
                 GO TO 6990-IC-X
             ELSE
                 MOVE CORP-CODE        TO  CODE-ARG.

      *---------- IF WE'RE AT THE MAXIMUM # OF CODES SPECIFIED
      *---------- FOR OPTION 6, STOP PROCESSING.
           IF ALL-CODES-DUIN AND SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "A"
             IF SF-MAX-CODES > 0
               IF SAVE-NUM-CODES = SF-MAX-CODES
                 GO TO 6990-IC-X
               END-IF
             END-IF.

      *------ SAVE STR-INV-DATE IN HOLD AREA, IF FREEZING DUE-TO-BE-
      *------ INVENTORIED, PGM WILL MOVE LOW VALUES TO ITEMS WITH
      *------ ZERO ONHAND SO THEY WILL SHOW UP FIRST ON THE RPT
      *------ SORTED BY INV. DATE
           MOVE STR-INV-DATE-CN        TO  HOLD-INV-DATE.

           IF SINGLE-CODES OR SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "D"
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF RANGE-OF-CODES
               IF CORP-CODE < SF-LOW-VALUE
                   GO TO 6100-INPUT-CODE-LOOP
               ELSE
               IF CORP-CODE > SF-HIGH-VALUE
                   GO TO 6100-INPUT-CODE-LOOP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF RANGE-OF-BIN
               PERFORM 6700-DETERMINE-BIN THRU 6790-DB-X
               IF BIN-FLAG = "Y"
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   GO TO 6100-INPUT-CODE-LOOP
           ELSE
           IF RANGE-OF-CLASS
               IF STR-CLASS < SF-LOW-VALUE
                   GO TO 6100-INPUT-CODE-LOOP
               ELSE
               IF STR-CLASS > SF-HIGH-VALUE
                   GO TO 6100-INPUT-CODE-LOOP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF ALL-CODES
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF ALL-CODES-DUIN
               PERFORM 6500-DETERMINE-DUIN THRU 6590-DD-X
               IF DUIN-FLAG = "Y"
      *************NEXT SENTENCE
                   ADD 1 TO SAVE-NUM-CODES
               ELSE
                   GO TO 6100-INPUT-CODE-LOOP
           ELSE
           IF RANGE-HIGHUSE
               PERFORM 6600-DETERMINE-HIGHUSE THRU 6690-DH-X
               IF HIGH-USE-FLAG = "Y"
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   GO TO 6100-INPUT-CODE-LOOP
           ELSE
               MOVE "INVALID FREEZE TYPE" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

           IF SF-CLASS-SELECT = SPACES OR "ALL"
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF SF-CLASS-SELECT = STR-CLASS
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               GO TO 6100-INPUT-CODE-LOOP.

           IF SF-NUM-MONTHS > 0
               IF STR-ACT-DATE-CN < CHECK-DATE-CYMD
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               GO TO 6100-INPUT-CODE-LOOP.

           IF SF-SORT-OPTION = "6"
               MOVE "K"                  TO  CDESC-DESC-OPTION
               CALL "CDESC" USING CDESC-RET-CODE, BASE, STATUS-AREA,
                 BU-DISPLAY-MSG, CODE-ARG, CDESC-DATA
               MOVE CDESC (1)            TO  SORT-KEYWORD-ADJ.

           MOVE CORP-CODE                TO  SORT-CODE.

      *------ IF WE ARE SELECTING CODES USING A RANGE OF BIN
      *------ LOCATIONS, USE THE BIN LOCATION WHICH CAUSED THE
      *------ CODE TO BE INCLUDED ON THE WORKSHEET.  OTHERWISE,
      *------ USE THE PRIMARY BIN LOCATION.  LOGIC SIMILAR TO
      *------ THAT USED IN PARAGRAPH 6700-DETERMINE-BIN IS
      *------ USED TO OBTAIN THE PROPER SORT-BIN VALUE.
      *------ -DAVE PLUM 24JUL1992
           IF RANGE-OF-BIN
               MOVE SPACES TO SORT-BIN
               PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 6
                OR SORT-BIN > SPACES
                   IF  STR-LOC (SUB) NOT < SF-LOW-VALUE
                   AND STR-LOC (SUB) NOT > SF-HIGH-VALUE
                       MOVE STR-LOC (SUB)  TO  SORT-BIN
                   END-IF
               END-PERFORM
           ELSE
               MOVE STR-LOC (1)            TO  SORT-BIN.

           MOVE STR-CLASS                TO  SORT-CLASS.
           MOVE HOLD-INV-DATE            TO  SORT-DATE.
           MOVE STR-HIGH-USAGE           TO  SORT-HU.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  SORT-NOTHING.

      *------ IF WE ARE UNFREEZING, THERE ARE NO EDITS AND NO REPORT
      *------ SO WE UNFREEZE IN THE INPUT ROUTINE.
           IF SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "B" OR "D"
               PERFORM 8100-FREEZE-UNFREEZE THRU 8110-FU-X
           ELSE
               RELEASE SORT-REC.

           GO TO 6100-INPUT-CODE-LOOP.

       6500-DETERMINE-DUIN.
           MOVE "N"                      TO  DUIN-FLAG.
           IF STR-PHY-INV-CYL NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE ZERO                 TO  STR-PHY-INV-CYL-9.

           IF STR-PHY-INV-CYL = 9999
               GO TO 6590-DD-X.

      *------ IF NOTHING ONHAND AND IF NO ACTIVITY SINCE IT WAS
      *------ LAST INVENTORIED, DON'T BOTHER INVENTORYING IT.
      *------ IF NOTHING ONHAND AND THERE HAS BEEN ACTIVITY,
      *------ DON'T INVENTORY IF IT'S BEEN INVENTORIED WITHIN
      *------ THE LAST 60 DAYS.
      *------ OTHERWISE, ITEMS WITH ONHAND OF ZERO SHOW UP FIRST
      *------ ON THE RPT SORTED BY INV DATE (TO MATCH TRPTDUIN)
           IF STR-ONHAND = 0
               IF STR-INV-DATE-CN = STR-ACT-DATE-CN
                 GO TO 6590-DD-X
               ELSE
                 IF STR-INV-DATE-CN > DAYS-AGO-60
                   GO TO 6590-DD-X
                 ELSE
                   MOVE LOW-VALUES TO HOLD-INV-DATE
                   MOVE "Y"        TO DUIN-FLAG
                   GO TO 6590-DD-X.

      *------ IF THE CODE WAS NEVER INVENTORIED, WE GO FROM THE
      *------ DATE THE CODE WAS INITIALIZED.
           IF STR-INV-DATE-CN = SPACES
               IF STR-INIT-DATE-CN = SPACES
                   MOVE "750101"       TO  GREGORIAN-DATE
               ELSE
                   MOVE STR-INIT-DATE    TO  GREGORIAN-DATE
           ELSE
               MOVE STR-INV-DATE         TO  GREGORIAN-DATE.
           MOVE GREGORIAN-YEAR           TO  YEAR.
           IF YEAR > 70
               MOVE 19 TO CENTURY
           ELSE
               MOVE 20 TO CENTURY.
           MOVE CENTURY-YEAR TO LAST-YEAR.
           CALL "CJULIAN" USING CENTURY-YEAR, GREGORIAN-MONTH,
                                GREGORIAN-DAY, JD-DDD.
           MOVE JULIAN-DATE-NUM          TO  LAST-INVS-JULIAN.

           ACCEPT GREGORIAN-DATE FROM DATE.
           MOVE GREGORIAN-YEAR           TO  YEAR.
           IF YEAR > 70
               MOVE 19 TO CENTURY
           ELSE
               MOVE 20 TO CENTURY.
           MOVE CENTURY-YEAR TO TODAYS-YEAR.
           CALL "CJULIAN" USING CENTURY-YEAR, GREGORIAN-MONTH,
                                GREGORIAN-DAY, JD-DDD.
           MOVE JULIAN-DATE-NUM          TO  TODAYS-JULIAN.

           SUBTRACT LAST-YEAR FROM TODAYS-YEAR GIVING YEAR-DIFF.
           IF LAST-INVS-JULIAN > TODAYS-JULIAN
               SUBTRACT LAST-INVS-JULIAN FROM 365 GIVING DIFF
               ADD TODAYS-JULIAN         TO  DIFF
               COMPUTE YEAR-DAYS = (YEAR-DIFF - 1) * 356
               ADD YEAR-DAYS             TO  DIFF
           ELSE
               SUBTRACT LAST-INVS-JULIAN FROM TODAYS-JULIAN
                 GIVING DIFF
               COMPUTE YEAR-DAYS = YEAR-DIFF * 365
               ADD YEAR-DAYS             TO  DIFF.

           IF DIFF > STR-PHY-INV-CYL-9
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  DUIN-FLAG.

       6590-DD-X.
           EXIT.

       6600-DETERMINE-HIGHUSE.
           MOVE "N"                      TO  HIGH-USE-FLAG.
           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 6
           OR HIGH-USE-FLAG = "Y"
               IF STR-HIGH-USAGE-AREA (SUB) < SF-LOW-VALUE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
               IF STR-HIGH-USAGE-AREA (SUB) > SF-HIGH-VALUE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   MOVE "Y"              TO  HIGH-USE-FLAG
               END-IF
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM.
       6690-DH-X.
           EXIT.

       6700-DETERMINE-BIN.
           MOVE "N"                      TO  BIN-FLAG.
           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 6
           OR BIN-FLAG = "Y"
               IF  STR-LOC (SUB) NOT < SF-LOW-VALUE
               AND STR-LOC (SUB) NOT > SF-HIGH-VALUE
                   MOVE "Y"              TO  BIN-FLAG
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM.
       6790-DB-X.
           EXIT.

       6990-IC-X.
           EXIT.

       7000-OUTPUT-CODES.
           IF SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "B" OR "D"
               GO TO 7990-OC-X.

           IF SINGLE-CODES
               CLOSE INVFILE
               OPEN OUTPUT INVFILE
           END-IF.

           MOVE HD-SPOOLER-NUMBER        TO  OVRPRTF-TOFILE-NUM.
           MOVE "*YES"                   TO  OVRPRTF-SHARED.
           MOVE HD-NO-OF-COPIES          TO  OVRPRTF-COPIES.
           PERFORM 996-OVERRIDE-PRINT-FILE.
           OPEN OUTPUT PRINTFILE.
           CALL "THDPRT2" USING HD-RET-CODE, HD-FILE-NAME,
             FNUM, HD-ROUTE-DATA, ESC-NAME.
      *------- SET UP THE HEADER THAT SHOWS THE USER WHAT OPTIONS
      *------- WERE PICKED.
           IF SF-SORT-OPTION = "1"
               MOVE "CORPORATE CODE"     TO  PRT-SORT-KEY
           ELSE
           IF SF-SORT-OPTION = "2"
               MOVE "BIN LOCATION"       TO  PRT-SORT-KEY
           ELSE
           IF SF-SORT-OPTION = "3"
               MOVE "ACCOUNTING CLASS"   TO  PRT-SORT-KEY
           ELSE
           IF SF-SORT-OPTION = "4"
               MOVE "LAST INV DATE"      TO  PRT-SORT-KEY
           ELSE
           IF SF-SORT-OPTION = "5"
               MOVE "H-U AREA"           TO  PRT-SORT-KEY
           ELSE
           IF SF-SORT-OPTION = "6"
               MOVE "KEYWORD/ADJECTIVE"  TO  PRT-SORT-KEY.

           MOVE SF-LOW-VALUE             TO  PRT-LOW-VALUE.
           MOVE SF-HIGH-VALUE            TO  PRT-HIGH-VALUE.
           IF SF-FREEZE-TYPE = "1"
               MOVE "SINGLE CODES"       TO  PRT-SELECT-KEY
           ELSE
           IF SF-FREEZE-TYPE = "2"
               MOVE "CORPORATE CODES"    TO  PRT-SELECT-KEY
               IF SF-NUM-MONTHS > 0
                 MOVE "NO ACT IN # MONTHS: "
                                         TO  PRT-OTHER-LIT
                 MOVE SF-NUM-MONTHS      TO  PRT-OTHER-NUM
               END-IF
           ELSE
           IF SF-FREEZE-TYPE = "3"
               MOVE "BIN LOCATIONS"      TO  PRT-SELECT-KEY
           ELSE
           IF SF-FREEZE-TYPE = "4"
               MOVE "ACCOUNTING CLASSES" TO  PRT-SELECT-KEY
           ELSE
           IF SF-FREEZE-TYPE = "5"
               MOVE "ALL ITEMS"          TO  PRT-SELECT-KEY
           ELSE
           IF SF-FREEZE-TYPE = "6"
               MOVE "DUE TO BE INV."     TO  PRT-SELECT-KEY
               IF SF-MAX-CODES > 0
                 MOVE "MAXIMUM # OF CODES: "
                                         TO  PRT-OTHER-LIT
                 MOVE SF-MAX-CODES       TO  PRT-OTHER-NUM
               END-IF
           ELSE
           IF SF-FREEZE-TYPE = "7"
               MOVE "H-U AREAS"          TO  PRT-SELECT-KEY.

           PERFORM 7800-HEADERS.
       7010-RETURN-LOOP.
           RETURN SORT-FILE AT END
               GO TO 7900-RL-X.

           MOVE SORT-CODE                TO  CODE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-GETKEY-MSTORERM-CD-O.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
               GO TO 7010-RETURN-LOOP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           CALL "CINVEDIT" USING BASE, STATUS-AREA, CODE-ARG,
             MESSAGE-BUFFER, BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
           IF MESSAGE-BUFFER-1 NOT = SPACES
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER       TO  P-MESG
           ELSE
               MOVE STR-PREV-CODE        TO  P-LC
               MOVE LOCAL-CODE-MSG       TO  P-MESG.
           IF SORT-DATE = LOW-VALUES
               MOVE "ONHAND = 0"         TO  P-MESG.
           MOVE CODE-ARG                 TO  P-CODE.
           MOVE 0                        TO  STR-INDEX, DESC-INDEX.
           WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM HEADER-0 AFTER ADVANCING 2.
           MOVE STR-UM                   TO  P-UM.
           MOVE STR-CLASS                TO  P-CLASS.
           WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM PRINT-LINE1 AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           ADD 1                         TO  CODES-ON-PAGE-COUNT.
           ADD 4                         TO  LINE-K.

      *-------GET DESCRIPTION FROM DDESC
           MOVE 7                        TO  CDESC-LINES-TO-GET.
           MOVE "F"                      TO  CDESC-DESC-OPTION.
           CALL "CDESC" USING CDESC-RET-CODE, BASE, STATUS-AREA,
             BU-DISPLAY-MSG, CODE-ARG, CDESC-DATA.
           IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1 NOT = SPACES
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

           PERFORM 8080-GET-DESCRIPTION UNTIL STR-INDEX > 6.

           IF CODES-ON-PAGE-COUNT > 3
               PERFORM 7800-HEADERS.

           PERFORM 8100-FREEZE-UNFREEZE THRU 8110-FU-X.
           IF  SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "A"  AND MESSAGE-BUFFER-1 = SPACES
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  CODE-ON-WORKSHEET
               MOVE CODE-ARG             TO  INV-CODE
               WRITE INV-RECORD.

           GO TO 7010-RETURN-LOOP.

       7800-HEADERS.
           MOVE 1                        TO  LINE-K.
           MOVE 0                        TO  CODES-ON-PAGE-COUNT.
           ADD 1                         TO  PAGE-K.
           ADD 3                         TO  LINE-K.
           MOVE PAGE-K                   TO  PAGE-NO.
           MOVE SF-NUM                   TO  P-WS-NUM.
           WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM HEADER-1 AFTER ADVANCING NEW-PAGE.
           WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM HEADER-1A AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  PRINT-RECORD.

       7900-RL-X.
           IF CODE-ON-WORKSHEET = "N"
               DISPLAY "WORKSHEET NOT CREATED, NO CODES COULD BE FROZEN"
               PERFORM 7800-HEADERS
               PERFORM 3 TIMES
                  WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM P-NO-CODE-BANNER
               END-PERFORM
               WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM P-NO-CODE-SKIP
               WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM P-NO-CODE-LINE1
               WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM P-NO-CODE-SKIP
               WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM P-NO-CODE-LINE2
               WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM P-NO-CODE-SKIP
               WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM P-NO-CODE-LINE3
               WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM P-NO-CODE-SKIP
               PERFORM 3 TIMES
                  WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM P-NO-CODE-BANNER
               END-PERFORM
           END-IF.
           CLOSE PRINTFILE.

       7990-OC-X.
           EXIT.

       8060-PRINT-DESCRIPTION.
      *----------PRINT A LINE OF DESCRIPTION WHICH ALSO CONTAINS A
      *----------BIN LOCATION. WE HAVE ALLOCATED ONLY 40 BYTES FOR DESCRIPTION,
      *----------SO KEYWORD/ADJECTIVE AND MANUFACTURERS WILL FIT ON ONE LINE,
      *----------BUT OTHER DESCRIPTION WILL TAKE 2 LINES.
           IF DESC-INDEX = 1
               MOVE P-LINE-2                 TO  P-DESC-HEAD
               WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM HEADER-2 AFTER ADVANCING 1
               ADD 1                         TO  LINE-K
           ELSE
               ADD 1                         TO  STR-INDEX
               PERFORM 8070-MOVE-BIN
               IF CDESC-TYPE (DESC-INDEX) = "K" OR "M"
                   MOVE P-LINE-2             TO  P-DESC-4
                   WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM PRINT-LINE4 AFTER ADVANCING 1
                   ADD 1                     TO  LINE-K
               ELSE
                   MOVE P-DESC-2             TO  P-DESC-4
                   WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM PRINT-LINE4 AFTER ADVANCING 1
                   ADD 1                     TO  STR-INDEX
                   PERFORM 8070-MOVE-BIN
                   MOVE P-DESC-3             TO  P-DESC-4
                   WRITE PRINT-RECORD FROM PRINT-LINE4 AFTER ADVANCING 1
                   ADD 2                     TO  LINE-K.

       8070-MOVE-BIN.
           IF STR-INDEX > 6
               MOVE SPACES               TO  P-BIN
               MOVE ZERO                 TO  P-BIN-ONHAND
           ELSE
             IF STR-LOC (STR-INDEX) = SPACES
                 MOVE SPACES               TO  P-BIN
                 MOVE ZERO                 TO  P-BIN-ONHAND
             ELSE
                 MOVE STR-LOC (STR-INDEX)  TO  P-BIN-LOC
                 IF MESSAGE-BUFFER-1 = SPACES
                     MOVE "____" TO P-UNDERLINE
                 ELSE
                     MOVE "****" TO P-UNDERLINE
                 END-IF
                 MOVE PRINT-LINE3          TO  P-BIN
                 IF SAVE-PRT-INV-FLAG = "Y"
                     MOVE STR-LOC-ONHAND (STR-INDEX) TO P-BIN-ONHAND
                 ELSE
                     MOVE ZERO             TO  P-BIN-ONHAND.

       8080-GET-DESCRIPTION.
           ADD 1                         TO  DESC-INDEX.
           IF DESC-INDEX > CDESC-LINES-GOT
               MOVE SPACES               TO  P-LINE-2
               MOVE "M"                  TO  CDESC-TYPE (DESC-INDEX)
           ELSE
               MOVE CDESC (DESC-INDEX)   TO  P-LINE-2.
           PERFORM 8060-PRINT-DESCRIPTION.

       8090-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       8100-FREEZE-UNFREEZE.
           MOVE "MSTORERM;"              TO  DSET-NAME.
           PERFORM 9999-DSET-LOCK.
           PERFORM 9999-GETKEY-MSTORERM-CD-O.

           IF SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "B" OR "D"
               MOVE "U"                  TO  STR-STATE
           ELSE
           IF SF-FREEZE-UNFREEZE = "A" AND MESSAGE-BUFFER-1 = SPACES
           AND (STR-STATE NOT = "F")
               MOVE "F"                  TO  STR-STATE
           ELSE
               PERFORM 9999-UNLOCK
               GO TO 8110-FU-X.

           PERFORM 9999-UPDATE-MSTORERM-CD-O.
           PERFORM 9999-UNLOCK.

       8110-FU-X.
           EXIT.

       9999-OPEN-STUFF.
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-PK-I.
           OPEN I-O   MSTORERM-CD-O.

       9999-CLOSE-STUFF.
           CLOSE      MPLTINFO-PK-I.
           CLOSE      MSTORERM-CD-O.

       9999-START-AT-CODE.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-CD-REC-O.
           START MSTORERM-CD-O KEY >= CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-CD-REC-O
               INVALID KEY CONTINUE
           END-START
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "START ERROR MSTORERM 9999-SAC" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

       9999-OVERRIDE.
           MOVE SPACES TO COMMAND-WORK.
           STRING "OVRDBF FILE(" DELIMITED BY SIZE,
              OVR-FROMFILE DELIMITED BY SPACES,
              ") TOFILE(" DELIMITED BY SIZE,
              OVR-TOFILE DELIMITED BY SPACES,
              ")" DELIMITED BY SIZE
            INTO COMMAND-WORK.
           CALL "QCMDEXC" USING COMMAND-WORK, COMMAND-LEN.

       COPY DLOCKCAL IN COPYLIB.
       COPY UNLOCK   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY OVRPFCAL IN COPYLIB.
       9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-PK-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-PK-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               IF HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG = "Y"
                   MOVE "GETKEY ERR 9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I"
                       TO BU-MSG-AREA
                   PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

       9999-GETKEY-MSTORERM-CD-O.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-CD-REC-O.
           READ MSTORERM-CD-O INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
      ***  IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
      ***      MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
      ***  ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               IF HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG = "Y"
                   MOVE "GETKEY ERR 9999-GETKEY-MSTORERM-CD-O"
                       TO BU-MSG-AREA
                   MOVE CODE-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                   PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

       9999-RESET-MSTORERM-CD-O.
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-CD-REC-O.
           START MSTORERM-CD-O KEY > CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-CD-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-GETSER-MSTORERM-CD-O.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ MSTORERM-CD-O NEXT INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "1"
               MOVE 11 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               IF HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG = "Y"
                   MOVE "GETSER ERR 9999-GETSER-MSTORERM-CD-O"
                       TO BU-MSG-AREA
                   MOVE CORP-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                   PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

       9999-BEGFIL-MSTORERM-CD-O.
           MOVE SPACES TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-CD-REC-O.
           START MSTORERM-CD-O KEY >= CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-CD-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-UPDATE-MSTORERM-CD-O.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           REWRITE MSTORERM-CD-REC-O FROM BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               IF HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG = "Y"
                   MOVE "UPDATE ERR 9999-UPDATE-MSTORERM-CD-O"
                       TO BU-MSG-AREA
                   MOVE CORP-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                   PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

